- In combination with carbamazepine, phenobarbital, or phenytoin
In combination with carbamazepine, phenobarbital, or phenytoin .
- In combination with efavirenz, nevirapine, or nelfinavir
In combination with efavirenz, nevirapine, or nelfinavir .
- In pediatric patients younger than 18 years of age
In pediatric patients younger than 18 years of age .
- In pregnant women
